(6000318, 879773, 93756, '<td valign="top">Cool, just not crisp enough in the focus. Love the blur in the wing but would like to see the head clearly.</td>', 'Cool, just not crisp enough in the focus. Love the blur in the wing but would like to see the head clearly.', '2010-05-10 16:27:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6000352, 878915, 45631, '<td valign="top">I think this was a clever idea but maybe to improve on it I would have spelt out the whole word ''ant'' and not had the coin as I think this takes away from an otherwise nice shot.</td>', 'I think this was a clever idea but maybe to improve on it I would have spelt out the whole word ''ant'' and not had the coin as I think this takes away from an otherwise nice shot.', '2010-05-10 16:43:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6000355, 879074, 92779, '<td valign="top">Cool- it looks as though Claude is enjoying his photo shoot:)</td>', 'Cool- it looks as though Claude is enjoying his photo shoot:)', '2010-05-10 16:44:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6000361, 879730, 92779, '<td valign="top">I really like the idea of her sitting in the suitcase... it really makes the photo!</td>', 'I really like the idea of her sitting in the suitcase... it really makes the photo!', '2010-05-10 16:46:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6000370, 879757, 16106, '<td valign="top">A bit more contrast would have helped to show off those lovely sun rays. And while it doesn''t really bother me, I have been hit often enough with the " I hate you image because the horizon is not level" comment to know that rotating the horizon to 90 degrees , even if it means the tree will not be at 90, will help your score.</td>', 'A bit more contrast would have helped to show off those lovely sun rays. And while it doesn''t really bother me, I have been hit often enough with the " I hate you image because the horizon is not level" comment to know that rotating the horizon to 90 degrees , even if it means the tree will not be at 90, will help your score.', '2010-05-10 16:55:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6000384, 879650, 16106, '<td valign="top">Nice framing, but I''m puzzled by the focal point. F is for fence and that is where you put the focus both in sharpness and tonal balance. A deeper DOF and darker image would have shown off those lovely, but blurry and blown out Alps.</td>', 'Nice framing, but I''m puzzled by the focal point. F is for fence and that is where you put the focus both in sharpness and tonal balance. A deeper DOF and darker image would have shown off those lovely, but blurry and blown out Alps.', '2010-05-10 17:01:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6000395, 879222, 16106, '<td valign="top">Couldn''t you have cut down that bush on the left? If only the tree were a bit more alone...nice tones and good colors on a tough shot.</td>', 'Couldn''t you have cut down that bush on the left? If only the tree were a bit more alone...nice tones and good colors on a tough shot.', '2010-05-10 17:06:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6000399, 879574, 80904, '<td valign="top">OUCH!!!</td>', 'OUCH!!!', '2010-05-10 17:09:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6000442, 878915, 16106, '<td valign="top">Great shot, and while the penny does give scale, I think it detracts more than it adds. Even if the ants were harder to guage the size of, it doesn''t detract from the image as much as the penny does.<br/> <br/>That said, clever idea, well executed, should do well</td>', 'Great shot, and while the penny does give scale, I think it detracts more than it adds. Even if the ants were harder to guage the size of, it doesn''t detract from the image as much as the penny does. That said, clever idea, well executed, should do well', '2010-05-10 17:47:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6000445, 879439, 113419, '<td valign="top">Your application will be denied....it says to complete with "red" pen</td>', 'Your application will be denied....it says to complete with "red" pen', '2010-05-10 17:49:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6000452, 879631, 16106, '<td valign="top">I wish the framing was a bit looser, its not quite as lonely as it would be with a wider frame.</td>', 'I wish the framing was a bit looser, its not quite as lonely as it would be with a wider frame.', '2010-05-10 17:55:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6000455, 879441, 113419, '<td valign="top">Japanese Maple; Maple = Acer</td>', 'Japanese Maple; Maple = Acer', '2010-05-10 17:57:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6000459, 879526, 16106, '<td valign="top">Great subject and framing, the only knock is some weird haloing around the people in the foreground and at the interface of the sky and the balloons.<br/>The colors and forms ought to carry this into ribbon contention</td>', 'Great subject and framing, the only knock is some weird haloing around the people in the foreground and at the interface of the sky and the balloons.The colors and forms ought to carry this into ribbon contention', '2010-05-10 17:59:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6000464, 879597, 113419, '<td valign="top">acer = maple</td>', 'acer = maple', '2010-05-10 18:03:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6000465, 878961, 16106, '<td valign="top">The title hurts you here, since there is no adobe in the frame. Calling it "airy architecture" or the like would have worked better IMHO. It is a nice architecture shot, and you did well with a complex set of tones and colors to let the eye move around the frame without excessive highlights and shadows.</td>', 'The title hurts you here, since there is no adobe in the frame. Calling it "airy architecture" or the like would have worked better IMHO. It is a nice architecture shot, and you did well with a complex set of tones and colors to let the eye move around the frame without excessive highlights and shadows.', '2010-05-10 18:04:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6000476, 879523, 16106, '<td valign="top">This is such a great location and subject, but its undercut by your editing, if the vibrance and blackpoint had been brought up, with a bit of vingeting, this image would rock.</td>', 'This is such a great location and subject, but its undercut by your editing, if the vibrance and blackpoint had been brought up, with a bit of vingeting, this image would rock.', '2010-05-10 18:13:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6000478, 879574, 16106, '<td valign="top">Or "ache". great capture.</td>', 'Or "ache". great capture.', '2010-05-10 18:14:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6000486, 879647, 16106, '<td valign="top">Nice clean clear shot. I''m not sure if the boat''s placement winds up hurting more than it helps. It is a bit too close to the auto for me. If it was further out in the frame it would add to the background, as it is it struggles for control of the eye as the eye moves around the outline of the SUV. minor quibble in a well handled shot. I''m guessing this is Robert working the DOF of the 10-22</td>', 'Nice clean clear shot. I''m not sure if the boat''s placement winds up hurting more than it helps. It is a bit too close to the auto for me. If it was further out in the frame it would add to the background, as it is it struggles for control of the eye as the eye moves around the outline of the SUV. minor quibble in a well handled shot. I''m guessing this is Robert working the DOF of the 10-22', '2010-05-10 18:22:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6000489, 878257, 72318, '<td valign="top">...the scientific classification of a "Spider" which many people will not guess within the first 5 seconds of looking at this photo... and some wont even get.<br/> <br/>Nice detail, colour and lighting - but not sure about the photo as a whole - the close crop, composition and POV dont seem to work for me.</td>', '...the scientific classification of a "Spider" which many people will not guess within the first 5 seconds of looking at this photo... and some wont even get. Nice detail, colour and lighting - but not sure about the photo as a whole - the close crop, composition and POV dont seem to work for me.', '2010-05-10 18:24:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6000496, 879762, 16106, '<td valign="top">When a voter has seen many shots of the same subject (ants, asparagus, flowers starting with A) and your shot still gets a "wow" you have done something right. Grats</td>', 'When a voter has seen many shots of the same subject (ants, asparagus, flowers starting with A) and your shot still gets a "wow" you have done something right. Grats', '2010-05-10 18:32:07.000000', NULL, 1),
