(6001359, 878915, 96751, '<td valign="top">Those are INCREDIBLY small ants!!! And I love how they''ve all lined up so politely. The question is, what did you do with them after the last shot you took :-)  I hope this finishes on the front page.</td>', 'Those are INCREDIBLY small ants!!! And I love how they''ve all lined up so politely. The question is, what did you do with them after the last shot you took :-)  I hope this finishes on the front page.', '2010-05-11 13:10:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6001396, 879651, 16106, '<td valign="top">I do love the lighting here and the intimate distance, but they come at a price for me. My eyes get pulled right into her lovely eyes, but instead of focusing on the iris and her expression, I focus on the reflection of the lights and it pulls me out of the examination of the subject into thinking of how the photograph was lit and the technical issues of the taking of the image, at the cost of examining the subject of the image.<br/> <br/>Had the lights been touching at the top and crossed  by a third forming a capital A, it would have been amusing for this challenge, but either that or the strong parallels you have here, would have detracted from the delicate and subtle beauty of this image. Still a very nice shot, but for me the reflections detract from what might have been a great shot.</td>', 'I do love the lighting here and the intimate distance, but they come at a price for me. My eyes get pulled right into her lovely eyes, but instead of focusing on the iris and her expression, I focus on the reflection of the lights and it pulls me out of the examination of the subject into thinking of how the photograph was lit and the technical issues of the taking of the image, at the cost of examining the subject of the image. Had the lights been touching at the top and crossed  by a third forming a capital A, it would have been amusing for this challenge, but either that or the strong parallels you have here, would have detracted from the delicate and subtle beauty of this image. Still a very nice shot, but for me the reflections detract from what might have been a great shot.', '2010-05-11 14:00:42.000000', NULL, 1),
