(6002687, 879610, 16106, '<td valign="top">Just a lovely shot. I think the ladybug detracts from the shot, but I know it is a popular DPC convention. Never the less the framing and lighting make this my pick for a ribbon</td>', 'Just a lovely shot. I think the ladybug detracts from the shot, but I know it is a popular DPC convention. Never the less the framing and lighting make this my pick for a ribbon', '2010-05-12 02:31:41.000000', NULL, 1),
