(6002689, 879581, 16106, '<td valign="top">Enough with the water drops already! Especially when they are as rich and beautifully lit as this. Its bloody annoying when some of us have to seek out far and distant places to shoot and all you have to do is turn on the tap to get a complex and subtle abstract with great detail and visual interest. I hate it. Great shot, top three, grats</td>', 'Enough with the water drops already! Especially when they are as rich and beautifully lit as this. Its bloody annoying when some of us have to seek out far and distant places to shoot and all you have to do is turn on the tap to get a complex and subtle abstract with great detail and visual interest. I hate it. Great shot, top three, grats', '2010-05-12 02:32:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6002690, 879684, 16106, '<td valign="top">A very nice shot, lovely glowing light, but too much of the top third of the image is blocked up blacks on my monitor. A bit more dodging out to bring up details, or cropping out to put the weight on the areas where there is detail would have helped. Never the less, this ought to do well</td>', 'A very nice shot, lovely glowing light, but too much of the top third of the image is blocked up blacks on my monitor. A bit more dodging out to bring up details, or cropping out to put the weight on the areas where there is detail would have helped. Never the less, this ought to do well', '2010-05-12 02:32:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6002807, 879201, 93565, '<td valign="top">Nice abstract- doesn''t feel the need to shoehorn an ordinary object, but instead depicts an everyday  item in an interesting manner. Nice shot.</td>', 'Nice abstract- doesn''t feel the need to shoehorn an ordinary object, but instead depicts an everyday  item in an interesting manner. Nice shot.', '2010-05-12 03:48:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6002811, 879693, 93565, '<td valign="top">I really like the lines created by the branches, and the bits of light streaming through is really nice too.</td>', 'I really like the lines created by the branches, and the bits of light streaming through is really nice too.', '2010-05-12 03:51:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6002816, 878856, 93565, '<td valign="top">Grunge processing feels a little over the top, but I''m a fan overall. Good clutter, though how is a lighted building abandoned? The shadow on the left keeps drawing me back to it over and over... and then I progress through the door. I like the flow.</td>', 'Grunge processing feels a little over the top, but I''m a fan overall. Good clutter, though how is a lighted building abandoned? The shadow on the left keeps drawing me back to it over and over... and then I progress through the door. I like the flow.', '2010-05-12 03:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6002823, 879686, 93565, '<td valign="top">I like how you''ve deconstructed the vehicle for us. I''d like to not have those bits of the tire cut off, but I feel like there must''ve been a reason for you to have done that, which I can''t see just looking at the end product.</td>', 'I like how you''ve deconstructed the vehicle for us. I''d like to not have those bits of the tire cut off, but I feel like there must''ve been a reason for you to have done that, which I can''t see just looking at the end product.', '2010-05-12 03:56:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6002832, 879529, 93565, '<td valign="top">Heavy processing is interesting... I like how much attention it brings to the sculpture... almost makes it appear radiant.</td>', 'Heavy processing is interesting... I like how much attention it brings to the sculpture... almost makes it appear radiant.', '2010-05-12 03:58:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6002839, 877764, 93565, '<td valign="top">Nice perspective and sky. The color of the building and painted sign really set it off great from the sky.</td>', 'Nice perspective and sky. The color of the building and painted sign really set it off great from the sky.', '2010-05-12 04:00:34.000000', NULL, 1),
