(6003255, 879665, 99263, '<td valign="top">Striking looking building. Very nicely photographed. I have been looking at this image again and I feel that maybe it would have been better had you utilized the allowed 800 pixels in the width and the height. A square crop of 800 x 800 pixels. In the current format I feel there is just too much sky. A square crop as I suggest would give the whole image more balance.</td>', 'Striking looking building. Very nicely photographed. I have been looking at this image again and I feel that maybe it would have been better had you utilized the allowed 800 pixels in the width and the height. A square crop of 800 x 800 pixels. In the current format I feel there is just too much sky. A square crop as I suggest would give the whole image more balance.', '2010-05-12 06:39:19.000000', NULL, 1),
