(6010586, 879275, 30861, '<td valign="top">You got an 8 from me with this amazing image. For the longest time I saw it as a figure walking in a tunnel, and then apperception set in and I saw the eye for what it was. and is. lovely work.</td>', 'You got an 8 from me with this amazing image. For the longest time I saw it as a figure walking in a tunnel, and then apperception set in and I saw the eye for what it was. and is. lovely work.', '2010-05-17 02:39:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(6010587, 879756, 30861, '<td valign="top">I thought it was fantastic. I gave it an 8. I wonder how much of the negativity stems from the fact that "art", in this case, is not a subject you photographed but, rather, a description of the result. I''m sure that didn''t fly well. But a fine, fine image.<br/> <br/>ETA:<br/> <br/>Come to think of it, is that an Art Museum? LOL...<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2010-05-17 01:42:31.</i></td>', 'I thought it was fantastic. I gave it an 8. I wonder how much of the negativity stems from the fact that "art", in this case, is not a subject you photographed but, rather, a description of the result. I''m sure that didn''t fly well. But a fine, fine image. ETA: Come to think of it, is that an Art Museum? LOL...', '2010-05-17 02:41:54.000000', '2010-05-17 02:42:31.000000', 0),
(6010589, 879275, 83313, '<td valign="top">On first look, I was going to say this was underrated, but on second look, the voting breakdown is fairly well balanced between people who liked and hated it. A success in my book! Keep doing what you''re doing.</td>', 'On first look, I was going to say this was underrated, but on second look, the voting breakdown is fairly well balanced between people who liked and hated it. A success in my book! Keep doing what you''re doing.', '2010-05-17 02:42:48.000000', NULL, 0),
