(6010702, 879040, 105457, '<td valign="top">Amazing that this didn''t ranked higher...<br/>Are people so caught up in a title that they disregard the photo?<br/>It was a great atmosphere Judi, I really really liked the dreamlike characteristic of the shot, especially because the theme is so dark.<br/> <br/>Scores aren''t everything, and you have a great picture.<br/> <br/>Joao</td>', 'Amazing that this didn''t ranked higher...Are people so caught up in a title that they disregard the photo?It was a great atmosphere Judi, I really really liked the dreamlike characteristic of the shot, especially because the theme is so dark. Scores aren''t everything, and you have a great picture. Joao', '2010-05-17 05:03:03.000000', NULL, 0),
