(6018805, 879610, 101536, '<td valign="top">Oh dear - big learning curve for me - I really didn''t realise that what I did was wrong - still very new to this game but as always I will learn from my mistake.<br/> <br/>I selected the original image and rotated it ever so slightly so that the petals were aesthetically more pleasing within the frame and then infilled the background with white....I must admit that this doesn''t seem so terrible to me but if what I''ve done is wrong I totally accept the decision. <br/> <br/>Knocked down but I will bounce back....<br/> <br/>AnnieK</td>', 'Oh dear - big learning curve for me - I really didn''t realise that what I did was wrong - still very new to this game but as always I will learn from my mistake. I selected the original image and rotated it ever so slightly so that the petals were aesthetically more pleasing within the frame and then infilled the background with white....I must admit that this doesn''t seem so terrible to me but if what I''ve done is wrong I totally accept the decision.  Knocked down but I will bounce back.... AnnieK', '2010-05-20 18:23:34.000000', NULL, 0),
