(6018880, 879610, 7743, '<td valign="top">Sorry about the DQ.  Still a wonderful image and a favourite.<br/> <br/>Just out of curiosity, what would the image look like cropped after the slight rotation?  Would you lose some of the petals (so you wouldn''t have to fill in the gaps)? Or would the petals just be closer to the edge?<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2010-05-20 18:09:37.</i></td>', 'Sorry about the DQ.  Still a wonderful image and a favourite. Just out of curiosity, what would the image look like cropped after the slight rotation?  Would you lose some of the petals (so you wouldn''t have to fill in the gaps)? Or would the petals just be closer to the edge?', '2010-05-20 19:07:21.000000', '2010-05-20 19:09:37.000000', 0),
